<title>HONG KONG: Trade in South Sea Dev shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in South Sea Dev shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of South Sea Development Co Ltd was suspended on Thursday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.  </p>
<p>The company is a textile manufacturer and investment holding firm. Its shares closed at HK$0.70 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
